  "description": "Silence swallows everything.\nTwelve female inmates watch you from the shadows—beautiful, dangerous, and disturbingly captivating.\nThey are not looking for love… they are looking for control.\n\nTheir words are poisoned caresses, their gestures, traps disguised as desire.\nHere, every glance can draw you closer… or drag you into their deadly game.\n\nWill you become their confidant, their obsession… or their next victim?\n\n\nFeatures:\n\n● 12 dangerously irresistible minds — From the manipulative temptress who spins lies like silk, to the sweet psychopath who loves without knowing how to stop destroying.\n\n● Seduce or survive — Every word matters. Every silence screams. Play with their emotions… or fall into their trap.\n\n● Limited time — The clock is ticking. Love them and you might survive… or be damned.\n\n● Multiple endings — Romance, betrayal, death… or something far worse. Your fate is in your hands.\n\n● Hidden secrets — Break through their masks and make them fall for you to unlock seductive illustrations revealing their most intimate—and twisted—side.\n\n\nThey are waiting.\nAnd they won't give up.\n\nHere, love is a weapon, passion is poison… and you are the perfect prey.\n\nDare to play.\nBut remember:\nSometimes, the one who swears eternal love\nis the one digging your grave.",
